//! SMLib's tessellation tests (NVIDIA usd-brep `tests/prog_test/src/smTessTest.cpp`, Apache-2.0; models in
//! `tests/data/smlib/tessellation`) on the native kernel. Generated by `tools/smlib_to_rust.py` from
//! `tools/smlib/tessellation.py` with SMLib's own results (the oracle); known failures (`tools/smlib_known_failures/tessellation.txt`)
//! must still fail.
//!
//! Not converted:
//! - face/normal tables, poly solvers 1–4, CreateTriStripFaces, SimpleMerge, STL and .pbp input/output, ray firing, decimation (its meshing converted), poly booleans (the smlib_poly_booleans suite) (tests 1–4, 9–16): SMLib's polygon library (SmPolyBrep), which the kernel has no counterpart of
#![allow(clippy::all)]

